WEBVTT

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:05.480
Next, Hibarigaoka Ruri-san.

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:07.900
<b>April 11</b>

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:07.900
Excuse me.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:13.950
Well... I'm not sure if I'd call it a hobby,
but I do cook every day.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:20.160
<b>Investigation Findings</b>

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:14.940
What else?

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:20.160
I also go to construction sites to see if he's...

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:20.160
<b>We apologize for 
the inconvenience.</b>

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.420
No, wait!

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.450
There's no need to hide it.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:25.120
We've already investigated that.

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:27.880
Just how much do you know?

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.760
Stop chuckling and tell me!

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:35.660
<b>Type of Misfortune: Tragic Love</b>

00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:39.200
What skills do you have, Kumegawa Botan-san?

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.270
Skills? Well...

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:45.680
I'm accustomed to administering 
first aid for a variety of reasons,

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:49.160
although I'm mostly a useless girl
who can only use it on herself.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:53.050
I also know quite a bit about supplements,
but not because I want to.

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:56.700
I see. By the way, is your head all right?

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.640
Don't worry about it.

00:00:58.640 --> 00:00:59.990
It happens all the time.

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:04.290
Is it all right if I perform first aid here?

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:06.520
Go to the nurse's office.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:08.690
<b>Type of Misfortune: Poor Health</b>

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:12.750
What are your interests and skills,
Hanakoizumi Anne-san?

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:13.850
Right!

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:16.110
My hobbies? I've got a bunch.

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:19.950
For example, I like buying 
juice from vending machines.

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:20.650
Huh?

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.630
And my skills...

00:01:23.630 --> 00:01:26.740
My skills... Uh...

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:30.750
My cheeks are really stretchy!

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:38.460
Also, I love animals, so I go 
to petting zoos all the time.

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:40.410
That's a wonderful interest to have.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:43.390
Do you like animals too, ma'am?

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:45.540
I specialize in eating them.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:46.230
Huh?

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:48.420
Eating them? Eat?

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:54.460
<i>So she's as unfortunate as 
our investigation indicated...</i>

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:58.100
What is it?

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:00.510
It's nothing.

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:02.620
This concludes your individual interview.

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:04.220
Thank you.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:11.880
<i>What was that four-leaf clover about?</i>

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:16.190
<i>The happiness class is given scarves
with the stem pointing upward.</i>

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:18.680
<i>During the egg assignment, too,</i>

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:21.440
<i>she was the only one to 
end up with a strange result.</i>

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:23.390
<b>Type of Misfortune: Bad Luck?</b>

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:27.620
Perhaps I should keep a closer eye on her.

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:09.930
Locker Room

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:12.560
I was so nervous!

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:15.520
But the interview was 
more fun than I expected.

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:17.800
What did she ask you?

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:20.520
Like, about my time in middle school,

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:23.260
my favorite subjects, 
and my interests and skills.

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:24.730
So we were all asked the same things.

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:25.740
Oh, right!

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:29.740
Thanks, Hibari-chan!

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:30.660
Oh...

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:33.510
Sure.

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:36.590
Ren, let's go to the gym.

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:38.790
Don't go too far ahead. You'll get lost.

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:41.480
We should go, too.

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:43.180
We'll miss the physical exam.

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:44.130
Okay.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:47.890
<b>Episode 2</b>

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:47.890
<b>April 11</b>

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:47.890
<b>The High-Tech Physical Exam</b>

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:50.220
I hope I grew taller.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.990
I'm worried about my weight.

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:54.940
I've been eating a little too much lately.

00:04:55.380 --> 00:04:59.150
Really? But you look very slim, Hibari-san.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:02.610
And Hanako-san, you're so small and cute.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:08.300
But as for me... Thanks to the slow but 
steady weight-gain loop I'm stuck in,

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:10.730
I've already achieved enlightenment.

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:11.790
R-Really?

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:16.290
Hey, Hibari-chan, are you worried
about your weight because you're in love?

00:05:16.570 --> 00:05:17.170
Huh?!

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:20.630
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh...
What are you talking about?

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:23.500
Oh, of course. You'd certainly 
want to look your best

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.120
for the person you love.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:27.090
You're such a pure maiden, Hibari-chan.

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:33.470
If you don't mind me asking,

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:36.730
what made you fall in love with him?

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:42.780
It wasn't anything in particular...

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:51.740
I happened to see him all the time 
while walking home from grade school.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:54.160
<b>We apologize for the inconvenience.</b>

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:54.160
At first, I didn't think much of it,

00:05:55.220 --> 00:06:00.570
but every day, he'd stand there 
without ever saying a word,

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:03.670
just quietly bowing.

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:08.150
After seeing his sincerity for so long,

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:10.680
before I knew it...

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:28.570
How could you make me say that?!

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:30.960
You really are a pure maiden, Hibari-chan.

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:35.040
<b>Fluff Fluff</b>

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:35.040
I hope to love someone that much someday.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:33.760
You're making my heart flutter.

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:38.580
E-Enough already!

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:42.960
Wh-What's that sound?

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:45.420
Look at that!

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:58.350
<b>Rrrumble</b>

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:54.970
Let's take another hallway.

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:55.640
Huh?

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:58.350
Nothing good will come of
tangling with that thing.

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:05.610
Found you.

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:07.070
It spoke!

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:10.490
Sorry, sorry.

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:14.580
I was just trying to make things more 
exciting, but I guess I overdid it.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:18.410
It's a bunny!

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:20.780
But it sounded mechanical...

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:22.810
Is it the school's equipment?

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:24.040
You're a sharp one.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:27.370
I'm Timothy, a robot that 
was built at this school.

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:29.470
I'm a guide for the happiness class.

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:31.180
Timothy!

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:35.850
My head is very delicate.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:38.480
It'll be a billion years before I let you touch it.

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:44.300
Is he really a robot?

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:45.850
I'm not sure...

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:53.980
I came to get you three because you're late.

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:56.330
Now, let's go to the gym!

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:58.140
Timothy!

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:02.670
Okay, here I go!

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:07.590
8.75123 centimeters...

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:09.760
That's very specific.

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:12.910
All the measuring equipment here 
is the latest technology.

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:15.480
This thing can even measure in picometers.

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:16.680
And...

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:20.310
You can do it, Botan-chan!

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:24.980
Negative?

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:29.670
It can still take your measurements 
even if you can't reach it.

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:33.200
I didn't think there was anyone who couldn't.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:35.670
My back!

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:38.750
Oh, good. My weight hasn't changed.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:41.070
I gained weight again this year.

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:43.900
Really? But you don't look fat at all.

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:49.530
What's wrong?

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:52.410
You've got something special.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.970
Beautiful

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:54.120
Is soy milk your secret?

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:53.970
<b>Big</b>

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:55.500
That's sexual harassment!

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:57.370
Didn't I say I was delicate?

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:58.390
Don't hit me.

00:09:06.680 --> 00:09:08.190
Wh-What's wrong?

00:09:14.270 --> 00:09:20.830
Botan, I think I know why you 
keep gaining weight every year.

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:23.230
Moo...

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:26.040
Next we'll measure your height.

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:29.500
This is automatic, too?

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:31.420
160 centimeters, I see.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:32.490
Click.

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:32.960
Recording...

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:35.240
This one's not as precise.

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:40.070
I'm gonna shrink!

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:45.060
My... head...

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:49.020
<b>Whack        Whack</b>

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:49.020
We can't measure you like this...

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:55.440
I'm going to play a sound.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:58.660
I don't hear anything.

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:01.180
The volume is set pretty high.

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:01.990
Is it broken?

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:02.950
I heard it.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:06.200
What? I haven't even turned yours on yet.

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:09.830
But I heard a woman's voice 
saying, "Hey, hey."

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:12.590
It said, "I'm right behind you!"

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:13.360
Stop!

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:15.130
It's a really clear voice!

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:15.130
I don't want to hear that!

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.680
Now I hear a man's voice saying, "Let's play!"

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:20.950
So many corpses...

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:24.550
That's odd.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.110
Are you okay?

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:39.900
I'm sorry.

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:43.580
I used all my strength during 
the physical examination.

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:46.090
Will you be able to eat lunch?

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:50.200
No matter the circumstances, 
you should always eat properly.

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:51.920
It's my family's motto.

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:56.550
I may be more of a cow than 
a human at this point.

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:01.430
In any case, I'll take Botan
to the changing room.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:05.340
Hanako, sorry to ask, but 
could you get us some drinks?

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:08.730
I think there were vending 
machines behind the school.

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:14.650
Whaaaat?!

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:12.080
<i>This should be enough for three people.</i>

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:13.470
<i>I'll take any kind of black tea.</i>

00:11:13.470 --> 00:11:16.440
<i>I'd like vegetable juice, please.</i>

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:20.530
Hanako?

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.030
Are you sure?

00:11:24.430 --> 00:11:25.260
Huh?

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:27.410
Are you sure you want 
vending machine drinks?

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.370
Y-Yes...

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.990
Got it! I'll do my best!

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:36.750
Is this her first errand?

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:42.760
Okay.

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:48.170
You seem to be feeling a lot better.

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:50.420
I am, thank you.

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:59.150
C-Come to think of it, 
Hanako's taking a long time.

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:01.460
I'm back!

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:05.600
What do you two want to drink?

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:10.040
Takoyaki
Soda

00:12:07.780 --> 00:12:10.040
Red Adder
Drink

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:10.040
Curry Milk

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:13.460
Oh, my...

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:16.250
What on earth are these?

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.960
I bought them from the vending machine!

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:19.500
That's not what I meant!

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:27.430
<b>Squeeze</b>

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:27.430
<b>Squeeze</b>

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:21.950
Didn't we say black tea and vegetable juice?

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:28.180
Yeah, so I prayed for black tea and 
vegetable juice while I pushed the buttons.

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:30.140
You prayed?

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:31.290
Yeah!

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:36.100
There's no way to know what will 
come out of a vending machine, right?

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:40.650
Although I was hoping for 
my favorite strawberry milk...

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:50.910
I would have been happy 
with café au lait, too.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:53.960
Vending machines aren't 
like Russian roulette.

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:57.870
I wanted to at least get the two
of you what you asked for...

00:12:57.870 --> 00:12:59.120
I'm sorry.

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:01.420
It's fine.

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:05.120
U-Um...

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:06.300
Right, let's eat!

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:07.390
Yeah, let's eat!

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:09.520
You're staying in your gym clothes?

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:12.390
Yeah. I'm starving, too.

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:14.390
Could you grab that side?

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:16.600
Huh? Okay...

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:18.780
Fusion!

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:22.860
Wow! Botan-chan, you have a cell phone?

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:25.930
They're actually against school rules,

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:31.780
but I have special permission, 
in case of a medical emergency.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:33.870
Really?

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.600
I always break mine right away.

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:38.250
And I don't need one.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:40.970
Hey, Botan-chan.

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:41.600
Yes?

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:44.090
Those meatball things look good.

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:46.360
Oh, would you like to trade?

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:48.280
Really? All right!

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:49.400
Then I'll take your...

00:13:49.400 --> 00:13:49.890
Yeah?

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:57.060
Those girls certainly are unusual.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:58.160
Yes.

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:05.490
Timothy, could you keep an eye 
on them for me today?

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:07.220
Okay.

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:15.450
O-Observe clubs?

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:18.420
You're planning on joining clubs?

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:20.890
I haven't decided yet.

00:14:20.890 --> 00:14:24.120
But if I see something fun,
I'd like to give it a try.

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:25.380
Let's go, let's go!

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:28.620
Then I'll be your guide.

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:30.220
Where did you come from?!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:31.340
Upsie-daisy.

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:35.340
There's nothing I don't 
know about this school.

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:36.680
Leave it to me.

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:38.270
Amazing!

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:39.940
Lead the way, then.

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:41.220
Okay!

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:44.410
Where should we start?

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:46.220
It's so hard to choose.

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:47.940
Hibari-chan, you pick first.

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:50.890
What? But I'm not really interested in clubs.

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:52.880
Everything is worth the experience.

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.660
<b>Cooking Classroom</b>

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:55.340
Okay, then...

00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:02.650
A pure maiden!

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:03.630
Wow!

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.260
You're good at this!

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:16.670
How cute!

00:15:16.670 --> 00:15:18.270
They look delicious.

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:19.430
Well done.

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:21.540
I make this stuff at home all the time.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.300
I'll treasure them forever!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:27.570
We'll be waiting for your applications!

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:30.490
Looks like your decision
has been made for you.

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:31.950
They're being hasty.

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:33.910
Where do you want to go next?

00:15:34.820 --> 00:15:37.110
There's somewhere I'd like to go.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.440
A sports club?

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:42.460
Go for it!

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:44.920
You can do it! You can totally do it!

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:53.850
You haven't even made it five meters.

00:15:57.910 --> 00:15:58.970
That's amazing.

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:10.490
Here goes!

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:17.600
M-My wrist...

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:18.540
H-Huh?!

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:21.930
Are you okay, Botan-chan?

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:23.960
Yes, I'm used to this.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.310
Unbelievable.

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:27.420
I guess I did expect this much, though.

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:30.490
We still have time. Any requests?

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:34.510
Are there any clubs where 
you can cuddle animals?

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:35.400
What?

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:39.150
Hmm... Is there a club like that?

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:41.730
You know, I'm pretty cuddly myself.

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:43.850
But you won't let me touch you.

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:46.140
Aren't you a robot?

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:52.490
Mr. Timothy-kun!

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:54.680
The pet society?

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:56.430
It's not a formal club.

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:59.450
They just get together to 
cuddle each other's pets.

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:01.820
That sounds fun!

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:03.580
Is that something you should do at school?

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:05.880
It's in that classroom.

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:10.010
I hear animals!

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:11.590
It's sucking me in...

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:11.590
Aren't they a bit loud?

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:22.140
Run!

00:17:25.470 --> 00:17:26.890
Wh-What's going on?

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:30.640
Wh-Why are they coming this way?

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.470
Aren't they coming after you?

00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:35.530
Aren't they after her?

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:40.660
I can't run anymore...

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:42.080
Botan!

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:44.910
Don't worry about me.

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:46.760
I can't let that happen!

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:47.880
Hibari-san!

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:05.640
What was that?

00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:18.490
I'm in paradise!

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:22.080
H-Hey, wait!

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:24.040
You're a robot! Can't you do something?

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:25.250
Like what?

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:28.680
Like shoot beams from your eyes 
or mouth or nose or something!

00:18:30.510 --> 00:18:32.170
What kind of robot do you think I am?

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:34.130
I-If you can't, that's fine.

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:38.340
Oh, very well.

00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:43.390
Timothy...

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:44.850
Do you...

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.680
Do you actually

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:48.810
have something?

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:55.040
No, nothing.

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:57.740
Then why did you do that?!

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:03.580
We managed to escape.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:04.410
I'm beat...

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:06.990
I wanted to pet the animals...

00:19:06.990 --> 00:19:08.620
That was fun, though.

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:10.370
It certainly was.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:13.630
I can't believe this happened while 
we were just observing clubs.

00:19:14.070 --> 00:19:17.150
I know. That was awful.

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:19.340
<i>You</i> got what you deserved.

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:23.550
Are you going to report this 
to Ms. Kodaira, too?

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:27.960
You were measuring our misfortune levels

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:30.140
during the physical examination, weren't you?

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.710
You knew?

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:32.730
Hey.

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.700
Hibari-chan, what are you going to do?

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:35.190
Huh?

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:37.880
Are you going to join the cooking club?

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:40.650
I don't think we'll be able to join any.

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:45.420
We wouldn't be able to go home 
together anymore, then...

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:47.840
But we'll still be together at school.

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:48.830
That's right.

00:19:49.300 --> 00:19:51.110
So has one of you decided?

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:55.440
I'm thirsty.

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:57.000
I'm going to get something to drink.

00:19:59.190 --> 00:19:59.960
<b>Black Tea</b>

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:02.650
See? It comes out like normal.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:07.080
They don't even sell curry 
milk or takoyaki soda.

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:09.820
Excuse me, I'm opening the vending machine.

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:13.500
Sheesh, who puts the wrong drinks in a machine?

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:20.100
She really is unlucky at everything.

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:27.130
What's he doing here?

00:20:29.190 --> 00:20:31.240
But the others are waiting...

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:36.000
Hibari-chan, there you are!

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.780
You took so long, we thought 
something had happened.

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:40.840
Oh, sorry. Here.

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:42.390
Strawberry milk!

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:44.680
Thank you.

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:49.890
That's him, isn't it?

00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:52.140
Huh? Yeah...

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:55.880
You can look at him all you want.

00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:57.650
Yeah. We'll wait for you.

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:00.360
You will?

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.150
He's important to you, right?

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:17.290
Hey!

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:20.040
I brought you a cooking club application form.

00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:22.510
I don't need it.

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:23.390
Huh?

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:28.720
If I joined a club, I'd have 
even less time to see him.

00:21:29.090 --> 00:21:33.340
Being in the going home club with 
you two might not be so bad, either.

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:37.120
Then we can still go home
together every day?

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:41.440
And we can walk side by side
and take detours and chitchat?

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:42.900
Huh? W-Well, yeah...

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:44.480
All right!

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:45.770
Hey, wait!

00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:48.360
It might not be bad at all.

00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:50.940
Let's go home together again tomorrow.

00:21:50.940 --> 00:21:51.820
Indeed.

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:53.830
Ren! Ren!

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:56.460
Are you okay? Are you alive?

00:21:57.670 --> 00:21:58.790
Sort of.

00:21:59.760 --> 00:22:03.670
Those two seem rather unfortunate, as well...

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>April 28</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>My First Happiness Training</b>

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:43.020
<b>Don't miss the next episode!</b>
